  "title": "chernobog — Hikari LLVM obfuscation recovery plugin",
  "summary": "An open-source Hex-Rays decompiler plugin that targets Hikari LLVM obfuscation: it recovers flattened control flow, removes opaque predicates, resolves encrypted strings and constants, and simplifies mixed boolean-arithmetic expressions with Z3-checked rules. It is tooling for studying protected binaries, including anti-cheat components.",
